    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d417">

                <pb facs="0518" n="508" sameAs="frus:frus1947v07/pg508"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">693.0023/3–3147: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the Soviet Union</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Smith</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moscow</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-03-31T11:00:00+03:00">March 31, 1947—11
                            a.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received March 31—8:38 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1102. Following is translation of body of note dated March 29 from FonOff in
                    reply to our note March 17.</p>
                <pb facs="0519" n="509" xml:id="pg509"/>
                <quote rend="blockquote">
                    <p>“Procedure for visits of foreign vessels to Dalny set forth in Ministry’s
                        note of March 3<anchor n="64" xml:id="d417-f1"/> corresponds to
                        Soviet-Chinese agreement of August 14, 1945 concerning port of Dalny.
                        Minister Foreign Affairs does not consider it possible to introduce changes
                        in above-mentioned procedure as that would not correspond to above-mentioned
                        agreement. [”]</p>
                </quote>
                <p>Dept repeat Nanking.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Smith</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d417-f1" n="64" xml:id="d417-f1-content">
                <p>See telegram No. 643, March 4, 8 p.m., from the Ambassador in the Soviet Union,
                        <ref target="#pg497">p. 497</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
